# Local Node / Prisma CLI. On Cloudflare the app uses the Hyperdrive binding +
# wrangler vars/secrets instead of this file.

# Supabase "Direct connection" (port 5432). ?schema=hameed keeps this app's
# tables isolated from the other apps sharing the same Supabase database.
